<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah. You on a adventure with your\nhomies?\rWhat’s a adventure without TREASURE\nhuntin’?\rAm I right, or am I right? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">GOOD! You get the real spirit of\nadventure. I like you! Take this.\fIt’s basically a metal detector for\nnerds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s mad stuff on the ground\nthat you can’t see.\rTouch the Dowsing Machine for a\nbit and see if it start beepin’.\rWhen it do, you know there’s\nsomethin’ near you.\rWalk around while you use it\nand you’ll find stuff easier.\rOh yeah--I heard there’s stuff\nin Ecruteak’s Burned Tower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh... To each their own, I guess...\nNo treasure for you. Boring.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Breaking and entering, huh?\nYou picked the wrong crib.\rHistory of Ecruteak\rWanna read it? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ecruteak had two towers. Each one\nhome to some strong flyin’ homies.\rBut one tower burned to the ground.\nNo smoke detectors. 1600s buildin’\fcode.\rNobody seen the two homies since...\rKeep readin’? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0619_T27R0801_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ecruteak was also home to three\nhomies that raced around town.\rThey say they was born from\nwater, lightnin’, and fire.\rBut they couldn’t control\nall that power.\rSo they say the three ran like the\nwind out into the grassland.</language>
	</row>
</body>
